CREATED:20260903T201601Z
DESCRIPTION:Encounter three rare historic prints of the Declaration of Ind
 ependence - including an official 1823 Stone Declaration - at the Durham 
 County Main Library and the Nasher Museum of Art. Presented as part of We
  the People\, the exhibition invites reflection on the nation's founding 
 ideals and their continuing influence today.
