DESCRIPTION:How are artists and performers of Asian descent disrupting the
  art world\, including the world of classical ballet?  What are current t
 rends in Asian American art and theater? How can we use performance theor
 y to better understand the everyday lives of Asian Americans negotiating 
 state restrictions and surveillance?  "Asian American Art and Performance
 " is an exciting symposium and film screening that explores new direction
 s in Asian American art\, performance\, and theater studies.'
DURATION:PT9H
