DESCRIPTION:Using carefully prepared materials\, participants will learn t
 o attach and coil longleaf pine needles around a gourd\, crafting a uniqu
 e bowl. All materials will be provided\, including hand-harvested longlea
 f pine needles from the sandhills of South Carolina. This workshop welcom
 es all experience levels as we explore the traditional art of coiled bask
 etry\, blending natural materials into a beautifully crafted piece.
