CREATED:20260831T144316Z
DESCRIPTION:The Duke Clinical Research Institute will host John Sundy\, MD
 \, PhD for a fireside chat during DCRI Research Forum\, the first of our 
 new season. Sundy is chief medical officer and head of research and devel
 opment at Seismic Therapeutic and an adjunct professor of medicine at the
  Duke University School of Medicine. A former Duke faculty member and DCR
 I leader\, he held leadership roles in immunology and inflammation resear
 ch and later led the Duke Clinical Research Unit. The conversation will c
 over his career journey\, his current work in biotechnology\, and where h
 e sees clinical research headed.
DURATION:PT1H
DTSTAMP:20260831T144316Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260922T120000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T144316Z
