CREATED:20260916T194610Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Corinna Barrett Lain\, George E. Allen Chair in Law at th
 e University of Richmond School of Law\, for a discussion of her new book
 \, Secrets of the Killing State: The Untold Story of Lethal Injection.\n\
 nProfessor Lain examines the administration of the death penalty in the U
 nited States\, exploring secrecy\, legal violations\, lethal injection pr
 actices\, and the human consequences of execution. Professor Brandon Garr
 ett will moderate a Q&A following the discussion.\n\nLunch will be provid
 ed.\n\nSponsored by the Wilson Center for Science and Justice\, the Duke 
 Decarceration Project\, and the Duke Law ACLU.
DURATION:PT1H
